{
  "info": {
    "name": "Foto Alpes - async-sec",
    "description": "Coleccion para probar el ejemplo Foto Alpes, rama `async-sec`.\n\nComo usarla:\n\n1. Levante los servicios con `docker compose up -d --build --wait`.\n2. Ejecute las peticiones en el orden de las carpetas.\n\nLos ids de usuario, producto y orden se guardan solos al crearlos, \nasi que no tiene que copiarlos a mano.\n\nIMPORTANTE: ejecute primero 'Obtener token'. El token queda guardado \ny las demas peticiones lo envian automaticamente.\n\nEsta rama usa un certificado autofirmado, asi que debe desactivar la \nverificacion en Postman: File -> Settings -> SSL certificate \nverification -> Off.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Jwt",
      "description": "Ejecute esta peticion PRIMERO. El token queda guardado automaticamente y las demas peticiones lo envian solas.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Obtener token",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api-queries/jwt",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api-queries",
                "jwt"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Unica operacion que NO requiere token. Guarda el token en la variable de coleccion 'token'."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Guarda el token para que las demas peticiones lo envien solas.",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const datos = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (datos.access_token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', datos.access_token);",
                  "        console.log('Token guardado. Ya puede ejecutar las demas peticiones.');",
                  "    }",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.log('No se pudo obtener el token. Estan los servicios arriba?');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Usuarios",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api-commands/users",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api-commands",
                "users"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Guarda el id en la variable 'userId'.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"ana\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Guarda el id devuelto para que las demas peticiones lo usen.",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const datos = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (datos.id) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', datos.id);",
                  "        console.log('userId = ' + datos.id');",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar usuarios",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api-queries/users",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api-queries",
                "users"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api-queries/users/{{userId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api-queries",
                "users",
                "{{userId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Productos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear producto",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api-commands/products",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api-commands",
                "products"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Guarda el id en la variable 'productId'.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Camara\",\n    \"description\": \"Camara de prueba\",\n    \"value\": 1500,\n    \"stock\": 100\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Guarda el id devuelto para que las demas peticiones lo usen.",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const datos = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (datos.id) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('productId', datos.id);",
                  "        console.log('productId = ' + datos.id');",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar productos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api-queries/products",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api-queries",
                "products"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar producto",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api-queries/products/{{productId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api-queries",
                "products",
                "{{productId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Modificar producto",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api-commands/products/{{productId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api-commands",
                "products",
                "{{productId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Camara\",\n    \"description\": \"Camara de prueba modificada\",\n    \"value\": 1800,\n    \"stock\": 500\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Ordenes",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear orden",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api-commands/orders",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api-commands",
                "orders"
              ]
            },
            "description": "El usuario y el producto llegan a este servicio por replicacion asincrona. Si acaba de crearlos y recibe un 400, espere unos segundos y reintente.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"user\": {{userId}},\n    \"product\": {{productId}},\n    \"quantity\": 10\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Guarda el id de la orden creada.",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const datos = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (datos.id) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', datos.id);",
                  "        console.log('orderId = ' + datos.id);",
                  "    }",
                  "}",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 400) {",
                  "    console.log('400: el usuario o el producto todavia no han sido replicados');",
                  "    console.log('en la base de datos del servicio de ordenes. Espere unos');",
                  "    console.log('segundos y vuelva a enviar esta peticion.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar ordenes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api-queries/orders",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api-queries",
                "orders"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar orden",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api-queries/orders/{{orderId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api-queries",
                "orders",
                "{{orderId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "La orden se crea en 'processing'. Vuelva a enviar esta peticion unos segundos despues para verla en 'completed' o 'failed'."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://localhost:5000"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "productId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "orderId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    }
  ]
}
